  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. <br>• Chop cauliflower into small florets.<br>• SPICY! This spice blend is hot! Add less if you’re sensitive to heat. Place cauliflower on a lined oven tray. Sprinkle over Mexican fiesta spice blend, drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat.<br>• Roast until tender and brown around edges, 20-25 minutes.<br>• In the last 5 minutes of cook time, remove tray from oven, then drizzle over the honey, tossing cauliflower to coat. Return to oven and roast until golden. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743a9fa5a49c635d8ac5cc/step-ceb61100.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When cauliflower has 10 minutes remaining, thinly slice cucumber into rounds. <br>• Thinly slice spring onion.<br>• Slice avocado in half, scoop out flesh and roughly chop.<br>• In a small bowl, combine mild chipotle sauce and the mayonnaise.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743a9fa5a49c635d8ac5cc/step-60f8c710.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a medium bowl, combine cucumber, mixed salad leaves, avocado and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil.<br>• Season with salt and pepper. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743a9fa5a49c635d8ac5cc/step-16ebfa20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide avocado salad between bowls. <br>• Top with Mexican charred cauliflower.<br>• Drizzle over creamy chipotle dressing. Sprinkle over spring onion. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68743a9fa5a49c635d8ac5cc/step-969b6c30.jpg"
    }
  ]
